.SP p2
.L 47.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Karis is the daughter of Dromar d'Ori, a renowned
.L 57.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]bounty hunter for the Galactic Peace Legion. When
.L 67.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]the elusive criminal Shadowman killed her father,
.L 77.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Karis dedicated herself to hunting him down,
.L 87.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]eventually tracking him to an unfamiliar,
.L 97.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]underdeveloped world: Earth. She's accompanied
.L 107.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]by Arasuni, a GPL-issued assistant robot.
.L 367.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]Quick-witted and sharp-tongued, Karis
.L 377.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]tends to act before she thinks. Earth's
.L 387.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]customs leave her thoroughly out of her
.L 397.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]depth, and she has a short fuse --
.L 407.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]especially when teased about her
.L 417.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]appearance.
.CP
.SH
\&Karis: Attacks
.PP
\&Kinetic Boomerang: Karis's signature weapon can be wielded versatilely, both as a blade and a boomerang.
.PP
\&Trick Shot: With finesse, Karis throws her weapon in a tight arc to disarm opponents.
.PP
\&Sweeping Strike: Take down multiple foes in a single throw!
.PP
\&Flex-Steel Cable: Her weapon can release a super-strong cable to entangle foes, among other creative uses.
.SH
\&Arasuni: Attacks
.PP
\&Iron Knuckle: Arasuni's immense size and strength allow him to deal a crushing blow.
.PP
\&Stun Pulse Rifle: While not the most powerful of weapons, it is useful for subduing stubborn foes.
